From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] input: rsinput: discard a partial frame on resume

The MCU loses power across system sleep and restarts its stream on a new frame.
A partial frame retained from before suspend is joined to that stream and fails
its checksum, so clear it before the MCU is reinitialised.

--- a/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
@@ -749,6 +749,7 @@
 {
     struct rsinput_driver *drv = dev_get_drvdata(dev);
 
+    drv->rx_len = 0;
     return rsinput_init_commands(drv);
 }
 
